151
00:09:00,260 --> 00:09:05,780
Agreed. Nothing else left to discuss. Launch planning is clear and risks are addressed.

152
00:09:05,780 --> 00:09:11,940
Excellent! Thanks for your time and focus. Let's execute with discipline and monitor closely.

153
00:09:11,940 --> 00:09:16,980
Absolutely. Closing the meeting now. Recap goes out immediately after this call.

154
00:09:16,980 --> 00:09:21,540
Perfect. Thanks again. Launch success depends on this clarity.

155
00:09:21,540 --> 00:09:27,140
Good morning. Thanks for making time today. I want us to use this session to go through the full

156
00:09:27,140 --> 00:09:34,180
