163
00:10:04,700 --> 00:10:07,700
Does that align with what you've seen in the materials?

164
00:10:07,700 --> 00:10:09,540
Yes, that aligns perfectly.

165
00:10:09,540 --> 00:10:12,860
I would add that the messaging should also subtly reinforce

166
00:10:12,860 --> 00:10:16,300
