192
00:11:44,480 --> 00:11:48,760
The campaign launch is scheduled for two weeks from today.

193
00:11:48,760 --> 00:11:52,120
Email sequence rollout starts on day one.

194
00:11:52,120 --> 00:11:55,560
Social posts begin the day prior to email.

195
00:11:55,560 --> 00:12:02,000
