237
00:14:12,440 --> 00:14:16,640
PR, earned media mentions, and sentiment analysis.

238
00:14:16,640 --> 00:14:17,640
Perfect.

239
00:14:17,640 --> 00:14:22,460
We should also agree on reporting cadence, daily monitoring for social and email in the

240
